cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "Code and data for: Discovery of High-Sensitivity Heat-Flux Sensor Materials via Active Learning"
abstract: >-
  Code and data accompanying the manuscript "Discovery of High-Sensitivity Heat-Flux Sensor Materials via Active Learning". Searches an
  eight-element alloy space for compositions maximizing the material-level
  heat-flux sensitivity |S_ANE| / kappa, through cycles of generative
  augmentation, surrogate training, Pareto-based candidate selection and
  synthesis. Includes the dataset as it stood at each of the three campaign
  cycles and the configurations that record what each cycle was run with.
